|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Unroll/Inline |                            |              | After user unroll and inline pragmas are applied                                       |
|               | (1) unroll                 | 6,131        | user unroll pragmas are applied                                                        |
|               | (2) simplification         | 4,757        | simplification of applied user unroll pragmas                                          |
